<title>USA: MBIA says will shut briefly on Friday for party.</title>
<headline>MBIA says will shut briefly on Friday for party.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA said that it will briefly shut its secondary market insurance department on Friday for a holiday party.</p>
<p>The department will be closed from 1200 EST to 1500 EST that afternoon. MBIA directed its clients to leave a message at 800-624-2669 during that period, in a prepared statement.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
